### New Service

**`apps/web/services/signature.service.ts`**

```typescript
// getActiveSignature(adminId) → AdminSignature | null
// createSignature(adminId, pngBuffer, displayName) → AdminSignature
//   - Hash the buffer: SHA-256
//   - Upload to Vercel Blob: signatures/{adminId}/{timestamp}.png
//   - Create DB record with nextChangeAllowedAt = now + 90 days
//   - Write AuditLog

// updateSignature(adminId, pngBuffer) → AdminSignature
//   - Check nextChangeAllowedAt > now() → throw SignatureLockError if too early
//   - Archive current to AdminSignatureHistory
//   - Upload new PNG to Vercel Blob
//   - Update DB record, reset nextChangeAllowedAt

// verifySignatureExists(adminId) → boolean
//   - Called by report.service before any PDF generation
//   - Throws NoSignatureError if not found

// embedSignatureInPdf(signatureUrl) → base64 PNG
//   - Fetches the blob URL, returns base64 for PDF embedding
```

